fractional digits, floats rounded to 9 decimals (``-0.0`` becomes ``0.0``). NaN and infinities are
refused: callers map them to ``None`` first (``memory.actions.json_safe``). numpy scalars become
Python numbers.

``row_hash(prev_hash, row) = sha256(prev_hash + canonical_json(row without prev_hash and hash))``.
``object_json`` is hashed as a parsed object, so the text DuckDB hands back never matters.
"""

